{"id":"vod_sn_36358","vodId":"36358","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"不思议游戏","name_cn":"不思议游戏","date":"1995-01-01","year":"1995","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/adfbb0897824a76e5969a666f38a7b95.jpg"},"summary":"夕城美朱（荒木香惠 配音）是一名普通的高中生，一日，她正和好友本乡唯（冬马由美 配音）在图书馆看书，两人无意间翻开了一本名叫《四神天地书》的古书，一道红光闪过，两人被吸入书中，穿越到了一个架空的时代。在那里，美朱的身份不再平凡，她摇身一变，成为了人们口中的朱雀巫女，而朱雀巫女的任务便是找齐传说中的朱雀七星士，召唤出朱雀，来实现她的愿望。随着旅途的展开，朱雀七星逐渐现身，而身为巫女的她，和其中的鬼宿（绿川光 配音）产生了深厚的感情。　　另一边，小唯也穿越到了与美朱同样的时代，她竟然成为了与朱雀巫女对立的青龙巫女，她也要找到属于她的青龙七星士。刚开始，一向胆小懦弱的她并不愿意与美朱为敌，但当看到美朱和鬼宿越走越近的时候，嫉妒使她的心慢慢得扭曲了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:42:32","playable":true,"episodeCount":52,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ppRueFPGgV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bxuTrff7L61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jtBMjZ0Gai1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/693FG1qa051/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aNiWjvvqJB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pGmgqxFhNd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0DX6YTN79y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cbAFNJzgpe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CkJNcEt8wN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ai58LpxYDk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/771nFpMuXd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VNDtYTyHEA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6XU3Wdeu5p1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hypQcZ